    others. Stored as count 10 with a floor of five Espionage, because the
    five others come from the same category list. The rule that one of each
    later pair must be Espionage or Military is in the note only. Rogue: Any
    is printed (+2%), stored as printed. Science is printed as math skills
    and Chemistry only; stored as the two Mathematics rows and Chemistry,
    leaving out the catalog''s analytical and pharmaceutical chemistry rows.
