## Lore

The Military Specialist is the Coalition Army''s intelligence officer: a soldier trained for espionage, information gathering and reconnaissance rather than the line of battle. Every one of them is a commissioned officer who has been through special schooling and has been fitted with cybernetics for the work. They begin their careers as Lieutenants.

Alignment: Any. Racial Restrictions: Human.

## GM Notes

Money: a monthly salary of 2200 credits, starting with one month''s pay, plus housing, food, clothing and access to military facilities. Quarters are a private officer''s apartment with its own bathroom and living room.

Vehicles: a conventional military vehicle of choice (motorcycle, jeep, hovercycle and the like) for daily use, and a Spider-Skull Walker for field use only.

Standard equipment includes one weapon for every W.P. with four extra E-Clips each; only the two energy weapons are in the starting kit here, so add a weapon for each of the three W.P.s of choice.

Equipment available upon assignment is whatever the mission calls for: surveillance gear, robot and conventional military vehicles, special weapons, extra ammunition, computer and laboratory access, and repairs. Everything is issued as needed at the commanding officer''s discretion, which can be very limited for an officer the commander dislikes.

Cybernetics: 1D4 cybernetic implants of choice to start, plus one bionic limb (hand and arm, or leg and foot) carrying two bionic weapons or sensors.
